WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Tap Sales, then Estimates.

00:03.000 --> 00:06.250
Tap + New Estimate.

00:06.250 --> 00:09.000
Tap Select Customer. Pick the customer.

00:09.000 --> 00:11.600
Type what the job is. Short. ALL CAPS.

00:11.600 --> 00:16.300
A is the customer. B is the description. Then tap Next.
